    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the problem is i don't want a \"quiet place\" to just sit in. i've spent my whole life running toward this peak. now that i'm standing on it, looking out at the view, i can see how much energy it takes just to stay standing. the descent is going to be so long, and so much slower. i look at the years ahead and i don't see more music or more discovery... i just see a long, slow fade into nothing. it feels almost disrespectful to the work to let it just rot away.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
